Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=119}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.91,0:03:05.92,Main-207+,Vendor,0,0,0,,要不要來點淡水蜆？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:07.75,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.63,0:03:13.38,Main-207+,Vendor,0,0,0,,進來坐！進來坐！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:15.51,Main-207+,Vendor,0,0,0,,來嚐嚐我們的招牌花烏龍麵！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.59,0:03:54.84,Secondary-207+,Carpenter,0,0,0,,我們這裡人手不足。\N能不能幫我一下？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.84,0:03:57.34,Secondary-207+,Carpenter,0,0,0,,喂！抬另一頭啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.97,0:04:00.22,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,喂喂喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.22,0:04:02.51,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,新來的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:06.23,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,這部分是你做的？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.68,0:04:09.31,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,是的，老大！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.73,0:04:11.27,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,有什麼問題嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:15.49,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,你是哪門子的笨蛋？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:17.57,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,這根本是完美！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:19.70,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,我在誇你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.70,Main-207+,Minatomo,0,0,0,,你這個大傻瓜！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:26.41,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,當然完美，因為我…！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:28.29,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,…演好你們的角色！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:34.38,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,喔、喔、喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.76,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,能聽到您這麼說真是太好了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.84,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,謝謝老大！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:42.72,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,229)}你這個吹牛大王！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:48.77,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:51.73,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,快來看快來看！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.73,0:04:55.69,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,這裡有一張紙——\N沒有任何機關或把戲！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:58.07,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,一張變兩張！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.07,0:05:01.86,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,兩張變四張！\N四張變八張！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:07.25,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,八張變十六張，再變三十二、六十四張！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:12.38,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,為您獻上翩翩飛舞的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:19.63,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,春日的櫻花雨\N與和之國黃昏的落雪！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:33.56,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,現在您見識到\N這把名刀有多鋒利了吧！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:35.69,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,只要被它輕輕一劃…{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:39.03,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,看它多輕易就能割傷你！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:48.37,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,但是，看好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:52.21,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,我這裡有的是蛤蟆油！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:56.34,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,只要塗在傷口上…！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:01.17,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,噹啷！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:04.09,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,看！看到了吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.72,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,效果就是這樣！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:08.76,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,血也止住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:11.85,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,這蛤蟆油可是東海的特產！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.85,0:06:13.94,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,快來買喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:15.73,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,－我要一個！\N－我也要！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:18.19,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,各位真有眼光！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.19,0:06:22.07,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,314)}來喔，快來看快來看！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.37,Main-207+,Umi,0,0,0,,你做得很好！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.37,0:06:38.63,Main-207+,Umi,0,0,0,,就是這樣！就是這樣！真是迷人！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:43.63,Main-207+,Umi,0,0,0,,你的手太低了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:46.55,Main-207+,Umi,0,0,0,,腰再壓低一點！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:49.85,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,是的，夫人…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.85,0:06:55.39,Main-207+,Umi,0,0,0,,你的目標幾乎是不可能的，\N所以你得逼自己更努力！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.39,0:07:01.11,Main-207+,Umi,0,0,0,,照這樣下去，將軍可沒辦法\N在期限內召你入宮！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:10.33,Main-207+,Umi,0,0,0,,繼續加油，寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:15.12,Main-207+,Robin,0,0,0,,是的，夫人…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:33.14,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這酒真好喝。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.73,0:07:40.94,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我很快會再來！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:42.44,Main-207+,Owner,0,0,0,,非常感謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.37,0:07:52.83,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,月色真美…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.93,0:08:15.27,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:23.32,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:27.32,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,血的味道…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:28.90,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.91,0:08:32.99,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,好香的味道啊，老兄。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:37.54,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,像是血腥味的香水…{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:50.80,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,－你被捕了！\N－你被捕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:54.51,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,對，斬人魔往那邊去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:57.14,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,你被捕了！你被捕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:08:57.77,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.77,0:09:00.31,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,{\i1}你{\i0}就是斬人魔！別反抗！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.31,0:09:01.48,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,咦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:07.15,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,－你被捕了！你被捕了！\N－你被捕了！你被捕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:12.53,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,看來我得把這些火苗…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:16.29,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,在燒起來之前撲滅！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:17.87,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,…演好你們的角色！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:22.21,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,各位，聽好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:23.58,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,你們現在身在和之國。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:26.13,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,這片土地的將軍是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:28.76,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,黑炭大蛇！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:36.39,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,他底下所有的官員\N都受凱多控制。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:40.31,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,所以他們個個都如此專橫跋扈。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.06,0:09:45.82,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,因此，只要你們動他們一根寒毛，\N凱多就會知道！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:50.61,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,在我們的夥伴全都趕到、\N做好戰鬥準備之前，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:54.45,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我們絕不能被發現！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.95,0:09:58.16,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,所以你們現在都必須\N假扮成普通百姓…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:01.71,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,並且安靜地——我再說一次，{\i0}安靜地{\i1}——{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:05.75,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,演好你們的角色！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:10.71,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,看來我別無選擇…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:12.09,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我知道了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:13.76,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,…是也…{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:15.18,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,喂，把他綁起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.18,0:10:18.93,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,－你被捕了！你被捕了！\N－你被捕了！你被捕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.44,0:10:29.78,Main-207+,Newsboy,0,0,0,,就是這個一直在\N街上作亂的大惡棍！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.78,0:10:33.86,Main-207+,Newsboy,0,0,0,,奉行大人終於、\N終於把他抓住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:36.74,Main-207+,Newsboy,0,0,0,,這名罪犯已被判處切腹！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:39.41,Main-207+,Newsboy,0,0,0,,詳情都寫在這裡面！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:41.45,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,我恨死他了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:44.29,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,他也對我丈夫拔過刀！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:46.13,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,這下總算安心了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.13,0:10:50.25,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,光是這個月，他就在夜裡的街上\N砍傷了三個人。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:56.97,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，我也能拿一份嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:10:58.18,Main-207+,Newsboy,0,0,0,,謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:02.52,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,索…索隆十郎…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:14.03,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,原來你叫索隆十郎…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.11,0:11:19.49,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,大家都很害怕那個斬人魔…{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:24.12,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,只要你切腹自盡，\N這座城鎮就能再度恢復安寧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:29.25,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,而且我簡直不敢相信…{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:33.01,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,你竟然還是個盜墓賊。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.67,0:11:35.88,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,二十三年前…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.43,0:11:39.80,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,在一場海賊騷動的混亂之中…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:43.52,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,傳說中的劍豪龍馬的遺體失蹤了…{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:46.44,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,連同他的名刀秋水一起！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:52.69,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,傳說龍馬曾一刀砍下\N一條兇猛巨龍的頭…{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.19,0:11:56.70,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,用的正是這把刀，秋水。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.99,0:12:02.37,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,不過，斬人魔啊…{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.99,0:12:06.58,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,那樁盜墓案發生在\N二十三年前。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.96,0:12:09.54,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,你看起來沒那麼老。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:12.29,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,你是從最初的盜賊手中偷來的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:16.97,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,唉，算了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:21.39,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,大名鼎鼎的秋水如今落在我手裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:27.94,Main-207+,Chintaro,0,0,0,,是的，大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.94,0:12:31.31,Main-207+,Chintaro,0,0,0,,好了，索隆十郎，時候到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:36.74,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:39.53,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這把刀沒有刀柄…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.87,0:12:44.16,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,…是也。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:48.54,Main-207+,Chintaro,0,0,0,,切腹用的刀通常很短\N而且沒有刀柄。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.54,0:12:52.17,Main-207+,Chintaro,0,0,0,,畢竟它本來就不是用來打鬥的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:56.59,Main-207+,Chintaro,0,0,0,,你懂切腹的正確禮儀嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:13:02.51,Main-207+,Chintaro,0,0,0,,如果你自稱是武士，\N就承認罪行、光榮地了斷自己吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:05.60,Main-207+,Chintaro,0,0,0,,在你開始痛苦之前…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:09.02,Main-207+,Chintaro,0,0,0,,我會為你介錯！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:30.33,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.33,0:13:31.46,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,永別了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:36.84,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,只是別像個孩子一樣哭哭啼啼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:42.05,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,體面地赴死是武士的榮譽。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.59,0:13:44.64,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,我們有證人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:46.39,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,也有足夠的證據！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.97,0:13:50.60,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,這將是一場你不配擁有的\N光榮之死！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:54.52,Main-207+,Tsujigiro,0,0,0,,你該慶幸自己還能切腹。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.79,0:14:13.33,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我聞到血的味道。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.92,0:14:18.30,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:21.38,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,就是兇手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.12,0:14:52.58,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,對不起了，錦右衛門。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.10,0:15:15.52,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.37,0:15:34.33,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,這裡…是和之國嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.31,0:15:53.64,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,大家都跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:56.60,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我想想…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.35,0:16:00.56,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們到底發生什麼事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:18.33,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.17,0:16:23.21,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.21,0:16:25.71,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,別弄壞我們的船！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.34,0:16:28.93,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,是隻巨大的狗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:34.64,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,是狗還是山豬啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.67,0:17:02.92,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,拿著刀的動物？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:05.67,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,看來和之國就是這樣吧！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:17.39,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我來到這裡看到的第一件事\N就是兩頭野獸在打架？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:47.09,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,聽好了，你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:50.38,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們想怎麼打都行，\N但別弄壞船！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:57.39,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,啊，對了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:02.48,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我剛剛在幹嘛來著？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:11.99,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們爬上瀑布之後\N看到了陸地…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.99,0:18:15.82,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,但還沒到岸\N就被捲進了漩渦…{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.82,0:18:17.53,Flashbacks-207+,Brook,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.53,0:18:20.16,Flashbacks-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,喂，潮水在倒流！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:23.21,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,撐住啊，{\i1}桑尼號{\i0}！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:28.09,Flashbacks-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美，抓緊我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.09,0:18:29.92,Flashbacks-207+,Nami,0,0,0,,謝謝你，香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:32.55,Flashbacks-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,這是我的榮幸，娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.55,0:18:33.84,Flashbacks-207+,Carrot,0,0,0,,香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:35.26,Flashbacks-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,嗯，抓緊我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:37.93,Flashbacks-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,好，我要跳上岸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:40.72,Flashbacks-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,準備好了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.52,Flashbacks-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,等等，香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:47.36,Flashbacks-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,帶我一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.86,Flashbacks-207+,Carrot,0,0,0,,喬哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:50.36,Flashbacks-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,不行！太重了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:53.78,Flashbacks-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,不要！別把我丟下！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:56.24,Flashbacks-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,抱歉，你得放手。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:18:59.99,Flashbacks-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,你怎麼能這樣…？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:01.79,Flashbacks-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,開玩笑的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.79,0:19:03.33,Flashbacks-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,抓緊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.33,0:19:04.75,Flashbacks-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:09.75,Flashbacks-207+,Brook,0,0,0,,那麼也請容我一同加入。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:12.51,Flashbacks-207+,Brook,0,0,0,,我愛你們大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.51,0:19:14.38,Flashbacks-207+,Brook,0,0,0,,抱緊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:16.97,Flashbacks-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,這骨頭還真硬！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.97,0:19:19.81,Flashbacks-207+,Nami,0,0,0,,才不是骨頭！骨頭超恐怖的！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:22.31,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,香吉士，用我的肚子吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.69,0:19:26.02,Flashbacks-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:31.65,Flashbacks-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,待會見！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:34.24,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,嗯，我馬上跟過去！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:39.87,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,好，輪到我了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.87,0:19:42.91,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}桑尼號{\i0}！我保證之後一定會找到你！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:51.34,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我上啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.17,0:19:56.05,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,那隻章魚？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:20:00.72,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你還想對我怎樣？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:04.73,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,可惡的章魚！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:20.99,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,然後，我醒來時就在這裡了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.70,0:20:24.70,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,所以我是在瀑布上面？還是掉下來了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:27.62,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我到底有沒有到和之國？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:35.76,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:37.30,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,生命之紙不見了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:40.43,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,弄丟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.43,0:20:42.01,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,掉進海裡了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:44.89,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:49.52,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,算了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.52,0:20:50.48,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,不管了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.48,0:20:52.56,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:57.32,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,放開我！我才沒說過那種話！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:20:59.86,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,也把我的米還給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:02.49,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,不，你明明就說了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.16,0:21:08.25,Flashbacks-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,等光月家回來，\N他們會好好教訓你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.25,0:21:09.87,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,你這個叛徒…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:15.09,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,你是那個邪惡家族、\N光月家的同夥！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.09,0:21:16.92,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,這可是重罪！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:19.80,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們不是把你賣去妓院，\N就是把你關進大牢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.80,0:21:20.88,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,絕不留情！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:22.64,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,可是…！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:24.39,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,先給我閉嘴。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:26.77,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們現在在執勤！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.56,0:21:31.39,Main-207+,Massui,0,0,0,,看！海灘上有艘船！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.39,0:21:33.48,Main-207+,Massui,0,0,0,,只有一個生還者？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.48,0:21:36.57,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,而且我們的狒狒\N正被那隻獅子狗纏住了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:38.99,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,看來牠當守衛沒那麼可靠嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.49,0:21:42.16,Thoughts-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,咦！狛千代？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:48.12,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,各位，夠了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.79,Main-207+,Massui,0,0,0,,老大！看來通報沒錯！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:52.42,Main-207+,Massui,0,0,0,,是那艘擅闖的船！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:21:54.25,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,{\i1}看得到船上的人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:55.54,Main-207+,Massui,0,0,0,,只有一個人。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:57.30,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,只有一個嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:22:00.05,Main-207+,Massui,0,0,0,,{\i1}把他打昏帶走！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.05,0:22:02.63,Main-207+,Massui,0,0,0,,{\i1}至少能讓他當個苦力！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.93,0:22:10.31,Main-207+,Massui,0,0,0,,乖孩子。好好睡吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.69,0:22:16.23,Main-207+,Massui,0,0,0,,等你醒來，我們會好好\N「款待」你這個奴隸的！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.54,0:22:32.46,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,搞什麼…？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.84,0:22:39.63,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,突然襲擊我？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.63,0:22:41.17,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,你這混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.01,0:22:47.72,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,我打不中他！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:50.72,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,{\i1}喂，怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.72,0:22:52.56,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,呃，沒什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.08,0:23:11.79,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,這片海灘還真吵鬧。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.25,0:23:13.66,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,可惡…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.29,0:23:15.92,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,喂，狒狒！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.92,0:23:18.84,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,別光站著看！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.21,0:23:20.92,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,獅子狗待會再抓！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.92,0:23:22.51,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,抓住那傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.51,0:23:29.85,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,其實，現在准許你…{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.85,0:23:31.35,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,殺了他！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.92,0:24:04.34,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們想幹嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.20,0:24:35.16,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,很好！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.16,0:24:38.29,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,別打得那麼兇啊，各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.38,0:24:44.13,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,你們到底在怕什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.13,0:24:46.72,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,他不過是個沒用的海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.44,0:25:04.61,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,看看你幹的好事，你這小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.19,0:25:07.24,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,我要殺了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.32,0:25:10.70,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,給我站住，臭小鬼！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.70,0:25:12.53,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,饒…饒了我！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.83,0:25:21.21,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我投降！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.54,0:25:23.17,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我投降！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.46,0:25:26.67,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你在幹嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.67,0:25:29.05,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我都說我投降了！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.05,0:25:31.43,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我投降！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.01,0:25:38.35,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我不會對你怎樣的！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.35,0:25:41.31,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,你…你說真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.73,0:25:43.19,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.19,0:25:45.15,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,呃…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.65,0:25:50.49,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,不好意思，趁你在這裡，\N能占用你一點時間嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.49,0:25:52.16,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,這…這是我的機會！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.11,0:25:55.66,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,機會？你什麼意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.66,0:25:57.37,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,好啊。那就來吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.37,0:25:58.83,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,咦？來什麼？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.16,0:26:02.08,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}黍糰子！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.34,0:26:07.09,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,來囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.09,0:26:08.00,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.00,0:26:10.01,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你的臉頰掉下來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.55,0:26:16.26,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,來，吃吧。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.98,0:26:27.94,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你…你在幹嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.46,0:26:43.67,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,握手。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.42,0:26:49.42,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.42,0:26:52.13,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,她馴服了那頭野獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.13,0:26:53.88,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.26,0:26:59.85,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我終於和\N兇猛的山狒狒成為朋友了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.85,0:27:00.89,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.89,0:27:03.02,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.02,0:27:05.15,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,原來你是能力者！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.15,0:27:07.48,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,這能力還真方便！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.44,0:27:13.61,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,好啦好啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.61,0:27:15.95,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你現在是我們的朋友了！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.37,0:27:19.70,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,乖孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.70,0:27:21.58,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,那是你的狗嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.33,0:27:23.75,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,是啊！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.75,0:27:25.79,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我幫牠取名叫狛千代！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.21,0:27:29.34,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,哦，狛千代！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.34,0:27:30.46,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,請多指教！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.46,0:27:32.46,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我是魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.51,0:27:39.01,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我叫阿玉。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.85,0:27:41.76,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,好，阿玉！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.76,0:27:43.18,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,也請多指教！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.18,0:27:44.98,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,請多指教！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.98,0:27:45.64,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.64,0:27:49.86,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我得先確認這個國家到底是不是和之國。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.32,0:27:51.98,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,這個國家？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.40,0:27:56.74,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,對，這裡就是和之國！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.07,0:28:00.95,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,你現在在和之國的九里地區…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.95,0:28:02.33,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.33,0:28:05.46,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,所以我{\i1}真的{\i0}在和之國！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.25,0:28:09.83,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我終於來到和之國了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.17,0:28:12.55,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,等著我，凱多！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.55,0:28:14.21,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,等等！「大哥」？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.63,0:28:15.34,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.34,0:28:17.55,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我什麼時候變成你大哥了？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.89,0:28:21.01,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,大哥就是大哥啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.35,0:28:22.85,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,這到底是什麼意思啊？{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.85,0:28:24.60,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,算了，也沒什麼大不了的。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.60,0:28:27.19,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,好的，大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.27,0:28:37.03,Main-207+,Soldier,0,0,0,,九里海灘那邊的通訊\N似乎中斷了。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.03,0:28:40.20,Main-207+,Soldier,0,0,0,,大概是被什麼人打倒了。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.57,0:28:42.41,Main-207+,Soldier,0,0,0,,我們不知道對方有多少人。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.58,0:28:45.70,Main-207+,Soldier,0,0,0,,我們該怎麼辦，老大？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.09,0:28:57.59,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,別告訴凱多。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.59,0:29:02.43,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,我來處理！
